/- File: SessionMultiLib/MoreTop.lean

  The session half of the moretop.ml translation: it supplies
  HolMultiLib.MoreTop's dependencies and exports every theorem by name.
  Importing this module is `needs "Multivariate/moretop.ml"`: its own `needs` are
  its imports, and each bundle is built by `initialize` when the module is
  loaded, in file order.
-/

